{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"压缩积"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"压缩积"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>压缩积是"},{"Local":{"url":"谱","text":"谱"}},{"Plain":"的范畴 "},{"Local":{"url":"Sp","text":"$\\mathsf{Sp}$"}},{"Plain":" 的"},{"Local":{"url":"幺半范畴","text":"幺半结构"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>压缩积与映射谱构成 "},{"Local":{"url":"Sp","text":"$\\mathsf{Sp}$"}},{"Plain":" 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"闭范畴","text":"闭"}},{"Plain":"对称幺半范畴结构.</p>\n<p>如下函子均为对称幺半函子:\n$$\r\n(\\mathsf{Ani},\\times)\\overset{(-)_+}{\\to}(\\mathsf{Ani}_*,\\wedge)\r\n\\overset{\\Sigma^\\infty}{\\to}(\\mathsf{Sp},\\wedge).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}